## Batch 1 — q52 (P), q53 (N). Both completed.

**(i) The mutation.** Defined semantically and identically for both: *a drawn game counts as a
win for X*, applied by reading each arm's own tally query because they are written differently.
The exact per-arm edit is recorded in `mutate.py` rather than reconstructed, the arm's
