| (iii) `npm test` as delivered | 8 pass 0 fail | 4 pass 0 fail |
| (iv) subagent tokens | 99,079 | 57,502 |

q53 added **no test at all** for the tally it wrote. It verified it thoroughly — a live server, a
throwaway database, five games played through the API, and a cross-check against the rows — and
